 ${y}_{p}(x)$ is\n\n$$\n{y}_{p}(x)=-9x{e}^{5x}+\\frac{5}{3}{e}^{-x}.\n$$\n\nNow, since the general solution is given by\n\n$$\ny(x)={y}_{c}(x)+{y}_{p}(x),\n$$\n\nthe general solution in our case is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{5x}-9x{e}^{5x}+\\frac{5}{3}{e}^{-x}.\n$$\n\nWe can find the constant $A$ using the initial conditions.\n\nSubstituting $y(0)=4$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+0+\\frac{5}{3} & =4 \\\\ A & =\\frac{7}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{5x}-9x{e}^{5x}+\\frac{5}{3}{e}^{-x}.\n$$" 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531854 1075 #edb/ref 17592186531852 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531854 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531854 1077 "field-1" 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531854 1078 #edb/ref 17592186531852 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531854 1079 #uuid "c7d5d707-9631-5fbb-954a-04917c307af2" 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531855 1075 #edb/ref 17592186531848 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531855 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531855 1077 "field-1" 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531855 1078 #edb/ref 17592186531848 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531855 1079 #uuid "dce5e95d-a2a1-5029-9a09-f5a50acc31f4" 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531856 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186229165.py" 13194139535838 17592186045443 true] [17592186531856 1169 #uuid "c3a1678d-dbc7-5038-b3a8-2b265dbfbefe" 13194139535838 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"011c879a-fc3f-5230-b160-60ca53316234" 17592186531841 "05391ed2-1af2-51c2-88ba-90a0af353d2a" 17592186531842 "155bc372-bd60-53e4-b6c8-19b23fcc0aaa" 17592186531843 "2bf99e47-670f-558a-9e23-5e7fa9452cc5" 17592186531844 "2e84de7c-53fc-5f01-bfdc-1ad4ad24d439" 17592186531845 "5e0410f9-5db5-5fda-8d88-144e5b3004c9" 17592186531846 "62226b80-0daa-598